OL,3,GNEWSAPupils trained to use life-saving
OL,4,Ableed kits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of a man who died after
OL,7,Fbeing stabbed on a night out has been
OL,8,Ftraining pupils to use life-saving
OL,9,Fbleed kits installed in Wolverhampton
OL,10,Fsecondary schools.
OL,12,FHolly Baird, from the Daniel Baird
OL,13,FFoundation, spoke to pupils at Smestow
OL,14,FAcademy in the city and hopes her
OL,15,Ffamily's campaign to deliver and
OL,16,Fdemonstrate bleed kits in schools will
OL,17,Fsave lives.
OL,19,FHer brother, 26-year-old Dan, suffered
OL,20,Ffatal stab wounds during a dispute
OL,21,Foutside the Forge Tavern in Digbeth,
OL,22,FBirmingham, in July 2017.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
