OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAPupils trained to use life-saving
OL,4,Ableed kits
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The chances are one of the children in
OL,7,Fthis class will use what they have
OL,8,Flearned, whether that be on a
OL,9,Fviolence-related injury or an
OL,10,Faccident," she said. "I love to see
OL,11,Fyoung people engaged and listening."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
